@startuml
skinparam dpi 110
title Make the Grade — case study reference (source: nealford.com/katas/kata?id=MakeTheGrade)

package "students" #E8F0FE { class StudentCard }

package "testing-centers" #E6F4EA { class Session }
package "grading" #FCE8E6 { class Submission }
package "reporting" #FEF7E0 { class ConsolidatedReport }

StudentCard ..> Session : registers in
Session ..> Submission : produces
Submission ..> ConsolidatedReport : feeds

note right of ConsolidatedReport
  kata.nocs
  consolidate results to a single location
  per state across all tests
end note
@enduml
